draft.prompt:
Write the next section of the bug triage report.

Report outline:
{report_outline}

Research findings:
{research_findings}

Memory search results:
{relevant_findings}

Previous iteration draft:
{section_draft}

Iteration: {iteration}

Write the next unwritten section from the outline. Include:
- For bug sections: description, file/location, severity, impact, reproduction steps if known, suggested fix
- For patterns section: identify common root causes across bugs
- For recommendations: prioritize by impact-vs-effort, include specific action items

Format as clean Markdown with proper headings.

assess.prompt:
Report outline:
{report_outline}

Latest section:
{section_draft}

Are there more sections from the outline that still need to be written? Respond 'yes' if sections remain, or 'done' if all sections are complete.
